{"version":1,"content":"<p>【Ban 客 😓】Amazon 近期傳出針對高價值硬體訂單採取嚴苛審核措施，有買家在 Amazon 分開下訂 4 台 NVIDIA DGX Spark 小型 AI 超級電腦，未料訂單全數遭到無預警取消，隨後該買家的 Amazon 帳號更遭官方直接封鎖。</p><p>與此同時，Epic Games 執行長 Tim Sweeney 亦透露遭遇類似情況，其訂購的兩張 NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 顯示卡在即將出貨前同樣遭到取消。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:22:18.042742+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:15:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T03:58:25.741275+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:34.176385+00:00","content_hash":"32f2ddb3c19a90fb62bb6c123e1882655c38e61696981fc497e786895da5f363","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}